        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, passenger car, electric, LiMn2O4, certified electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, passenger car, electric, LiMn2O4, certified electricity
Average data for the operation of an average battery electric vehicle. 20kWh/100km from Swiss certified electricity.;
UUID: 7202919b-d1d6-362b-b947-ee7819bfe289
Energy consumption from Swiss certified electricity is included. Emissions of particulate matters and heavy metals are accounted for, unless of combustion origin. Particulate emissions comprise abrasions emissions only.  Heavy metal emissions to soil and water caused by tyre abrasion are included.
Location: Data refer to Swiss conditions
Technology: BEV, LiMn2O4/graphite battery pack, 100Wh/kg, actual standard, 2009. Middle class passenger car (similar to VW Golf)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7202919b-d1d6-362b-b947-ee7819bfe289.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
